{"about_the_game":"You are trapped in a endless hallway of doors. Push the doors that are marked push and pull the doors marked pull.  There is no escape.. eventually you will pull a push door or push a pull door- once you do your game is over.<br><br><strong>How to play</strong><br>- Click and drag up to push doors open. <br>- Click and drag down to pull doors open.<br>- Correctly push or pull doors to earn coins.<br>- Swipe in the center of two doors to open both.<br><br>Be sure to avoid broken or locked doors. If you see a door marked with &quot;Use other door&quot;- use the other door.<br><br>Spend coins to decorate your rooms. Rooms you decorate will randomly appear while your play. If you successfully open a decorated room you will receive the bonuses of the items in that room!<br><br>Can you get passed 10 Doors? 20 Doors? 100 Doors? Are you the best push/puller in the world?! Find out and play Doors Push or Pull today!<br><br>Accept the fate of no escape. Will you push or pull that door incorrectly?","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"icon":"c5821141fae27f814a0e5d7998241c90d1dc461c.jpg","localized_name":"The Journey Begins","name":"The Journey Begins","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/854390/c5821141fae27f814a0e5d7998241c90d1dc461c.jpg"},{"icon":"c5821141fae27f814a0e5d7998241c90d1dc461c.jpg","localized_name":"Pinnacle of Hard Work","name":"Pinnacle of Hard Work","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/854390/c5821141fae27f814a0e5d7998241c90d1dc461c.jpg"},{"icon":"c5821141fae27f814a0e5d7998241c90d1dc461c.jpg","localized_name":"Pinnacle of Great Wisdom","name":"Pinnacle of Great Wisdom","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/854390/c5821141fae27f814a0e5d7998241c90d1dc461c.jpg"},{"icon":"c5821141fae27f814a0e5d7998241c90d1dc461c.jpg","localized_name":"Pinnacle of Perfection","name":"Pinnacle of Perfection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/